    "https://careers.ua.edu/jobs/lpn-contingent-on-call-no-benefits-530253-tuscaloosa-alabama-united-states": {
      "title": "LPN",
      "description": "LPN - Contingent / On-Call (No benefits) - 530253 - Tuscaloosa, Alabama, United States My settings Featured Jobs Research Healthcare Information Technology (IT) Life at UA Campus Life Tuscaloosa Benefits Work Life Search Jobs Job Alerts Staff Jobs Student Jobs Faculty Jobs UA System Jobs My Application Kiosk mode LPN - Contingent / On-Call (No benefits) - 530253 Tuscaloosa, Alabama, United States Apply Now Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search LPN - Contingent / On-Call (No benefits) - 530253 Tuscaloosa, Alabama, United States Health Care / Social Services Closing at: Sep 28 2026 - 22:55 CDT Add to favorites View favorites Pay Grade/Pay Range: Minimum: $19.33 - Midpoint: $24.18 (Hourly N5) Department/Organization: 508111 - Capstone Village Assisted Living Normal Work Schedule: Varies; Every other Saturday & Sunday 7:00am to 11:00pm Job Summary: The LPN facilitates quality patient care within the scope of licensure. Additional Department Summary: Works two sixteen (16) hour shifts every other weekend. Provides direct nursing care to residents. Delegates and supervises the care provided by resident assistants. Administers medications. Performs treatments and procedures. Obtains specimens as needed. Completes documentation as required. Required Minimum Qualifications: Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) in the State of Alabama in good standing. Additional Required Department Minimum Qualifications: Final candidates must submit to and successfully pass a post-offer drug screen. Skills and Knowledge: Knowledge of the Alabama Department of Public Health Rules & Regulations for Assisted Living and Specialty Care Assisted Living. Knowledge of Dementia Education, Care, and Training (DETA) and dementia in the elderly. Knowledge of the DETA Brain series, pharmacological management of dementia, the Dementia Assessment series provided by DETA, or equivalent training approved by the State Health Officer. Preferred Qualifications: One (1) year of experience working as a licensed practical nurse. Background Investigation Statement: Prior to hiring, the final candidate(s) must successfully pass a pre-employment background investigation and information obtained from social media and other internet sources. A prior conviction reported as a result of the background investigation DOES NOT automatically disqualify a candidate from consideration for this position. A candidate with a prior conviction or negative behavioral red flags will receive an individualized review of the prior conviction or negative behavioral red flags before a hiring decision is made. Equal Employment Opportunity : The University of Alabama is an Equal Employment/Equal Educational Opportunity Institution. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment or volunteer status without regard to any legally protected basis and will not be discriminated against because of their protected status. Applicants and employees of this institution are protected under Federal law from discrimination on several bases. More information is available in the EEOC’s Know Your Rights: Workplace discrimination is illegal poster. The University of Alabama affirms its longstanding commitment to institutional neutrality, free speech, and academic freedom. Apply Now REGISTER FOR JOB ALERTS: First Name (required) e42e34e6 Last Name (required) bcbd8688 Email (required) b3bd6cd3 Select from the lists below to receive information about specific jobs. 40bfff8d Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Health Care / Social Services Health Care / Social Services Employment Type Contingent / On-Call (No benefits) Contingent / On-Call (No benefits) Submit Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you! EMAIL THIS JOB TO A FRIEND: First Name (required) 3fea3841