ags will receive an individualized review of the prior conviction or negative behavioral red flags before a hiring decision is made. Equal Employment Opportunity: The University of Alabama is an Equal Employment/Equal Educational Opportunity Institution. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment or volunteer status without regard to any legally protected basis and will not be discriminated against because of their protected status. Applicants and employees of this institution are protected under Federal law from discrimination on several bases. More information is available in the EEOC’s Know Your Rights: Workplace (https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf) discrimination is illegal poster. The University of Alabama affirms its longstanding commitment to institutional neutrality, free speech, and academic freedom. Apply Now REGISTER FOR JOB ALERTS: First Name (required) 77d32f62 Last Name (required) e6702aa4 Email (required) c095332e Select from the lists below to receive information about specific jobs. 039ef024 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Tenure/Tenure-Track Faculty Tenure/Tenure-Track Faculty Employment Type On-Campus Undergraduate/Graduate On-Campus Undergraduate/Graduate Submit Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you! EMAIL THIS JOB TO A FRIEND: First Name (required) 875a03ae Last Name (required) 21a18ddc Email (required) 88b2567c Friend's Information 196e6adf Share Now Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you for sharing! Please note, all Employment positions close at 10:55pm CST. Non-Exempt positions are posted a minimum of 3 days. Exempt positions are posted a minimum of 7 days. Faculty positions are posted a minimum of 30 days. Ready to Apply? First Name (required) bddf74f